# TrackLess Development Rules

## Mandatory Release Versioning
Whenever any code or UI change is made in this repository:
1. Always bump the version in VERSION.txt (e.g. 1.3.1 -> 1.3.2).
2. Ensure app/src/main/assets/index.html settings footer reflects TrackLess vX.Y.Z.
3. Build the release APK with Gradle so TrackLess-vX.Y.Z.apk is generated.
4. Commit with the version in the commit message and push with git tag vX.Y.Z so GitHub Actions generates a unique release.

## UI/UX Rules
- No native alert() dialogs in webview. Use liquid glass inspector or modals with haptic feedback.
- No emojis in functional controls or list bullets. Use minimalist stroked vector SVG icons.
